Source: pgmp
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), libgmp-dev, python3
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/dvarrazzo/pgmp

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pgmp
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pgmp
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: multiple precision arithmetic types for PostgreSQL
 pgmp adds integer and rational PostgreSQL data types backed by the GNU
 Multiple Precision Arithmetic Library.
